        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Victor Wong Showcase"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;The Second City’s third annual Victor Wong Fellowship presents &amp;#8220;Dynasty Babies”, a fantasy-filled comedy tour through the minds of this year’s fellows. Watch as they share sketches that turn love, longing, power, and catharsis on their heads. A regal comedic buffet awaits!&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img loading=&quot;lazy&quot; decoding=&quot;async&quot; class=&quot;alignleft wp-image-19907 size-full&quot; src=&quot;https://platform.secondcity.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/VW-ScreensArtboard-.png&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;1920&quot; height=&quot;1080&quot; srcset=&quot;https://platform.secondcity.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/VW-ScreensArtboard-.png 1920w, https://platform.secondcity.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/VW-ScreensArtboard--300x169.png 300w, https://platform.secondcity.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/VW-ScreensArtboard--1024x576.png 1024w, https://platform.secondcity.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/VW-ScreensArtboard--768x432.png 768w, https://platform.secondcity.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/VW-ScreensArtboard--1536x864.png 1536w, https://platform.secondcity.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/VW-ScreensArtboard--1200x675.png 1200w, https://platform.secondcity.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/VW-ScreensArtboard--1400x788.png 1400w&quot; sizes=&quot;auto, (max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px&quot; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n"
      }
    ],
