      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Improvised news room. Come join the cast of Extra Extra as we twist today&amp;#8217;s headlines and make you laugh at today&amp;#8217;s greatest stories through the lens of a news room, interviews, and scenes inspired by everything!&lt;/p&gt;\n"
      }
