    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "New Week New Show"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;New Week! New Show! After a successful show run to start the year, the New Year New Show team is back by popular demand. Every week is a brand new sketch show, motivated by audiences suggestions from the week before. So yes, basically like a certain late-night New York show. This talented cast whips up new material weekly for audiences to come roaring back to. Maybe there will be musical numbers, or audience involvement, or anything in between. Who knows?! We certainly don&amp;#8217;t! New Week, New Show includes award-winning comedians, dedicated performers, and talented comedians. So come on down to see history made where every evening is opening and closing night at the same time.&lt;/p&gt;\n"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/eventAttendanceMode": [
      {
        "@id": "http://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/eventStatus": [
