        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Laughs and Magic"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Get ready for an unforgettable night of mirth and wonder with the crew of Laughs &amp;amp; Magic!&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;This is a night where the magic of laughter meets&amp;#8230;.actual magic! Let some of the best comics in the city leave you in stitches before the amazing Gambit mesmerizes you with feats unheard of!&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Located at the prestigious Second City&amp;#8217;s Theatre &amp;#8217;73 at 110 Harbour St downtown!&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Brought to you by Downtown Laughs follow on instagram @downtownlaughs_to&lt;/p&gt;\n"
      }
    ],
